1. Include necessary C++ libraries for file I/O, string manipulation, and input/output.
2. Define a constant string variable containing the name of the input text file.
3. Declare variables to hold the input text as lines and the word to search for, and initialize a counter variable for counting the number of occurrences of the search word.
